{
  "statement": "I appreciate the consensus on merging EFF-05 and SAF-02 for overdue notifications, which strengthens both accountability and efficiency. I support the proposal to allow a temporary increase in borrowing limits to 7 based on member history, as it balances performance with safety. However, I maintain that TRU-01 and SAF-06 should remain distinct to reinforce our security protocols. Additionally, I advocate for a unified approach to data protection compliance (RES-01) and encryption (TRU-03) to ensure we meet regulatory standards while safeguarding user privacy. This comprehensive approach strengthens our commitment to security and user trust.",
