      "type": "redundant",
      "description": "Both TRU-01 and SAF-06 ensure that only authenticated members can access borrowing features, leading to redundancy."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["RES-01", "TRU-03"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "The requirement for data protection compliance (RES-01) may conflict with the encryption standards in TRU-03, depending on specific regulations."
